⚡ How to Run & Deploy
​1. Build the All-In-One Image
​Run the script as root or with sudo (required for loopback device mounting):

qemu-system-x86_64 -enable-kvm -m 2048 -hda berry-mini-fog.img -bios /usr/share/OVMF/OVMF_CODE.fd

sudo ./make_mini_live_img.sh

2. Flash Directly to USB
​Write the single .img directly to a target USB drive. The partition structure and pre-baked persistence partition are transferred immediately:

sudo dd if=berry-mini-fog.img of=/dev/sdX status=progress bs=4M

